        "status": "answered",
        "uncertainty": "partial",
        "reason": "supported_explanation",
        "answer_text": "Fuzhou shadow puppetry is listed as traditional theatre from Wafangdian, Liaoning.\n\nShadow puppetry is a traditional form of storytelling where flat figures are held behind a lit screen, so the audience sees their shadows move. Think of it like an early kind of animation, but performed live by hand. Have you ever seen a shadow play?",
